qe(q,'dl-fundamentals-q11','workedExample','The parent fills stdin while cat copies to stdout. Once stdout buffering fills, cat stops reading; stdin then fills and the parent stops writing. Neither reaches the read/release the other needs. communicate(data) coordinates input and output, avoiding this ordinary pipe cycle. Actual capacity and the byte count at which blocking occurs are platform-dependent.','UnsupportedfewhundredKiBremoved.',pipe)
